00:28:44.310 --> 00:28:48.790
And then in the episode that aired, you'll see it quoted as M-A-U-R-I-E.

645
00:28:48.950 --> 00:28:49.310
Mm-hmm.

646
00:28:49.450 --> 00:28:52.330
But it was actually spelled M-O-R-I in the shooting draft.

647
00:28:52.550 --> 00:28:52.690
Okay.

