00:29:25.910 --> 00:29:26.430
Oh.

659
00:29:26.650 --> 00:29:28.590
Because Kelly has on a green sweater.

660
00:29:28.830 --> 00:29:30.470
Meredith has on a green cardigan.

661
00:29:30.790 --> 00:29:32.630
Megan has on a green blouse.

662
00:29:32.630 --> 00:29:35.810
And there is a turquoise green lunch bag on the table.

663
00:29:36.030 --> 00:29:36.470
Oh.

664
00:29:36.690 --> 00:29:37.190
Green scene.

665
00:29:37.350 --> 00:29:37.930
Green scene.

666
00:29:38.070 --> 00:29:38.950
Green in the break room.

667
00:29:39.130 --> 00:29:40.170
Green in the break room.

