00:31:47.610 --> 00:31:57.710
And what it is, is it is a sandwich that he has picked out the middle of and left the crusts.

720
00:31:58.850 --> 00:32:02.750
It's like he ate it from the inside out.

721
00:32:02.990 --> 00:32:05.790
It is the weirdest thing.

722
00:32:06.310 --> 00:32:12.270
Are we finding out right now that Jim is actually the person that eats like a squirrel and not Angela Martin?

723
00:32:12.470 --> 00:32:13.670
I think so.

