00:32:14.330 --> 00:32:20.470
But, you know, for a scene like this, it would just say in the script, they're in the break room having lunch.

725
00:32:20.610 --> 00:32:26.510
And Phil Shea would have to go around to all of us and ask us what we wanted to eat in the scene.

726
00:32:26.510 --> 00:32:34.610
And for me, depending on how close it was to actual lunch, I would either pick a substantial meal or something small.

727
00:32:34.610 --> 00:32:37.910
So I'm eating a salad and some grapes.

728
00:32:38.470 --> 00:32:39.890
That is not a meal to me.

729
00:32:40.010 --> 00:32:42.990
So we must have shot this after lunch because I was like, you know what?

730
00:32:43.030 --> 00:32:43.910
I will have already eaten.

731
00:32:44.010 --> 00:32:44.890
Just give me something light.

732
00:32:45.110 --> 00:32:47.810
They were always very mindful that my character was a vegetarian.

733
00:32:47.810 --> 00:32:54.130
So I often would be eating fruit or a salad or some kind of veggies or chips or something.

734
00:32:54.550 --> 00:32:57.270
I'm going to need a picture of that Jim sandwich.

735
00:32:57.490 --> 00:32:58.190
Thank you very much.

