00:33:15.410 --> 00:33:19.890
But they're also going to let you know they have not told anyone in the office.

741
00:33:20.530 --> 00:33:24.990
Yeah, I loved it when Jim was like, you know, the yakety yaks in this office, they'll have a field day.

742
00:33:25.370 --> 00:33:28.830
So this is true, but they're keeping it to themselves.

