00:33:33.970 --> 00:33:36.350
He goes to Dwight and Dwight knew all of it.

746
00:33:36.870 --> 00:33:37.310
Yeah.

747
00:33:37.750 --> 00:33:40.470
Oh, this is going to make Michael spiral even more.

