00:33:58.070 --> 00:34:01.290
I hate, hate, hate being left out.

757
00:34:02.290 --> 00:34:17.450
Whether it's for a sport or like not being picked for a team or being picked for a team and then showing up and realizing that the team doesn't exist or that the sport doesn't exiSt.

