learned, which is that Stanley is having a midlife crisis.

892
00:40:31.340 --> 00:40:31.600
Yeah.

893
00:40:31.820 --> 00:40:33.260
Because he was out at this club.

894
00:40:33.760 --> 00:40:36.160
But Dwight says, no.

895
00:40:36.560 --> 00:40:38.800
Stanley is way past the middle of his life.

896
00:40:38.800 --> 00:40:44.640
And Phyllis is like, Michael, what you're saying isn't true because Terry is out of

897
00:40:44.640 --> 00:40:46.180
town and Stanley hates crowds.

