there with someone other than his wife.

919
00:41:56.280 --> 00:42:00.740
The amount of time it takes Michael to clue in on something.

920
00:42:00.860 --> 00:42:01.520
Oh my gosh.

921
00:42:01.640 --> 00:42:02.840
